Package: tdepackagekit-trinity
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, packagekit
Recommends: polkit-agent-tde
Suggests: apt-config-icons, apt-config-icons-large
Description: PackageKit software manager for the Trinity Desktop Environment
 Install, remove and update software on Trinity with one window: browse and
 search packages, review and apply updates, see the history of changes, and
 enable or disable repositories. A tray icon says when updates are available,
 and package files can be installed by opening them.
 .
 It talks to the PackageKit service, so it works with the same package
 database and tools as the rest of the system.
